\begin_layout Section
Pipeline 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The RV32G processor adopts a classic 5-stage pipeline architecture as shown
 in the below figure 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:Pipeline-Architecture"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

\end_inset

 —Instruction Fetch (IF), Instruction Decode (ID), Execute (EX), Memory
 Access (MEM), and Write-Back (WB)—augmented with additional stall, kill,
 and forwarding logic to manage hazards and ensure correct instruction execution.
 Each stage is designed for optimal throughput while maintaining support
 for advanced features like floating-point operations, and memory-mapped
 I/O.
 
\end_layout

