\begin_layout Section
System Control Unit (SysCtl)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The SysCtl Unit acts as a central controller for events that affect all
 other units, like interruptions and exceptions.
 The Control and Status Registers in RISC-V privileged ISA control the essential
 core settings.
 Hence, these CSRs are also managed by SysCtl Unit.
 Figure 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
