\begin_layout Standard
The processor boots from the address 32'h0000_0000, which is the base address
 of the instruction memory (BOOT ROM) in our case.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
When the first time processor sends the BASE_ADDRESS, there is a icache
 miss.
 Then the virtual address is given to the TLB block and physical address
 is given out with a tag_valid signal.
 In our case, since we have disabled the translation for ease of use, we'll
 have physical address = virtual address.
 When the 
\emph on
tag_hit
\emph default
 is 1'b1 and 
\emph on
hit_out
\emph default
 is 1'b0, then the state machine inside the 
\series bold
cachefsm
\series default
 block goes to the service miss state(2'b01).
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In the state SERVICE_MISS, the physical address is given to the instruction
 memory for fetching the instruction in burst.
 We have a cache line of 256 bits, that is 8 words (32-bits).
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
When the whole cache line is fetched, the cachefsm signals 
\emph on
we 
\emph default
to the icache controller for writing the cache line in to the memory.
 Physical tag along with the 
\emph on
tag_valid
\emph default
 is also written to the tag array memory.
 When 
\emph on
we 
\emph default
comes from the cachefsm, the FSM inside the icache controller state 
\emph on
state_we
\emph default
 goes to 2 (2'b10).
 In state 2, it cache line and tag is written on to the ICACE SRAM, and
 in next cycle it again comes to state 1.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Parallely, states of cachefsm are also moving.
 When the state of cachefsm is 2'b10, it raises the 
\emph on
vpn_to_ppn_req_3
\emph default
 signal, which goes to the icache controller and the state goes to 0.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This 
\emph on
vpn_to_ppn_req_3
\emph default
, is used to read the tag again from the TLB and compare it with the tag
 coming from the TAG SRAM ARRAY.
 It it matches, then it is a hit otherwise miss.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
When the cache hits, it sends the 
\emph on
instruction[31:0] 
\emph default
to the pipeline unit using block select counter.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Now then the PC goes to 32'h0000_0020, the index increments and we encounter
 a cache miss, since the tag from the TLB(physical) doesnt matches with
 that from the memory.
 So signal i_hit goes down.
 Now the state in cachefsm again goes to SERVICE_MISS.
 At this moment, the tag_valid[VA] for the next upcoming way is written
 1'b1 and cache again fetched the next line from the memory.
 
\end_layout

