 Hence it needs to write the data at x6 to the location 0x0000_4000.
 Since this cache line is currently not there, there's a miss and the whole
 cache line will be brought to the dcache array and correspinsing tag (0x00004),
 along with the valid bit and write bit will be stored in the TAG array
 of the selected way.
 Since LRU[0] is 0, the way0 is selected and it is written 1.
 The dirty bit is also written to 1 as shown in the figure 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:Cache-flush-mechanism"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

\end_inset

 .
